wikitext2_test_head.txt is an excerpt (the first 181 lines, 88,203 characters) of
the WikiText-2 raw test split (Merity et al., "Pointer Sentinel Mixture Models",
2016), taken unmodified from the Hugging Face dataset Salesforce/wikitext,
revision b08601e04326c79dfdd32d625aee71d232d685c3,
file wikitext-2-raw-v1/test-00000-of-00001.parquet
(sha256 5f1bea067869d04849c0f975a2b29c4ff47d867f484f5010ea5e861eab246d91),
with the "text" rows concatenated as-is.

